  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the implementation of the KAPAME-strategy - Evaluation of the implementation of the KAPAME strategy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering av genomf&#xf6;randet av KAPAME-strategin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strategin f&#xf6;r kapacitetsutveckling, partnerskap och metoder som st&#xf6;djer Agenda 2030 f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling (KAPAME) genomf&#xf6;rs under &#xe5;ren 2018-2020. Insatsen utg&#xf6;rs av en f&#xf6;ljeutv&#xe4;rdering p&#xe5; strateginiv&#xe5; som avser att st&#xf6;dja Sida i att systematiskt f&#xf6;lja upp, utv&#xe4;rdera och l&#xe4;ra av genomf&#xf6;randet. Utv&#xe4;rderingen kommer att st&#xf6;dja arbetet med den f&#xf6;rdjupade strategirapporteringen 2021 samt facilitera &#xe5;terkommande uppf&#xf6;ljningsaktiviteter och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra metoder f&#xf6;r resultatuppf&#xf6;ljning under strategins livscykel.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategy for capacity development, partnership and methods that support Agenda 2030 for sustainable development is implemented between 2018-2022. The contribution is an ongoing evaluation at the strategy level, which aims at supporting Sida to systematically monitor, evaluate, and learn during its implementation. The evaluation will support the work with the in-depth results reporting due 2021, and facilitate recurrent monitoring activities as well as improving methods for capturing results during the remainder of the strategy life cycle.</narrative>
  </description>
